 style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.258em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 从 1 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>）就是缓存在 KV 块里的历史。连续存储时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1 \\ldots k_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是内存里一段连续张量，kernel 一路顺读即可。分页之后，它们被切在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil t/B \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 个可能彼此相距很远的物理块里。kernel 必须先知道「这些块都在哪」，才能把它们逐个取来参与运算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"按块表-gather-kernel-的新职责\">按块表 gather：kernel 的新职责</h2><p>答案是让 kernel 接收块表作为额外输入。PagedAttention kernel 在计算每个序列的注意力时，会拿到这个序列的块表，据此把逻辑上连续的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1 \\ldots k_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从散落的物理块里 gather 出来参与运算。执行流程如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[decode 第 t 个 token] --&gt; B[取查询向量 q_t]&#10;  B --&gt; C[读入该序列块表]&#10;  C --&gt; D[遍历逻辑块 0..t/B]&#10;  D --&gt; E[查表得物理块 ID]&#10;  E --&gt; F[从物理块读 K/V 到片上]&#10;  F --&gt; G[分块算 q·k 分数]&#10;  G --&gt; H[softmax 加权求和 V]&#10;  H --&gt; I[输出该 token 注意力结果]\">flowchart TD\n  A[decode 第 t 个 token] --&gt; B[取查询向量 q_t]\n  B --&gt; C[读入该序列块表]\n  C --&gt; D[遍历逻辑块 0..t/B]\n  D --&gt; E[查表得物理块 ID]\n  E --&gt; F[从物理块读 K/V 到片上]\n  F --&gt; G[分块算 q·k 分数]\n  G --&gt; H[softmax 加权求和 V]\n  H --&gt; I[输出该 token 注意力结果]</pre><p>这套「按块表 gather」的核心，用伪码看格外清楚——逻辑连续的历史，被块表翻译成一次次物理跳转：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def paged_attention(q_t, block_table, seq_len):&#10;    scores = []&#10;    for i in range(ceil(seq_len / BLOCK)):&#10;        phys = block_table[i]              # 逻辑块 → 物理块，一次跳转&#10;        k_blk, v_blk = load(phys)          # 块内 16 token 连续读入片上&#10;        scores.append(q_t @ k_blk.T)       # 分块算分数&#10;    return softmax(concat(scores)) @ gather_values(block_table, v)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> paged_attention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q_t, block_table, seq_len):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ceil(seq_len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BLOCK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        phys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> block_table[i]              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 逻辑块 → 物理块，一次跳转</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        k_blk, v_blk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load(phys)          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 块内 16 token 连续读入片上</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        scores.append(q_t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k_blk.T)       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 分块算分数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> softmax(concat(scores)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gather_values(block_table, v)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 kernel 是<strong>分块处理</strong>的：它一次加载一个物理块的 K、V 到 GPU 的片上共享内存或寄存器，算完这个块对注意力分数的贡献，再换下一个块。由于块内的 16 个 token 是物理连续的，这一步的访存依然是顺序的、高效的；非连续只发生在块与块的边界，靠块表跳转一次即可。这样既保住了带宽利用，又拿到了分页的内存灵活性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么不能直接套用-flashattention\">为什么不能直接套用 FlashAttention</h2><p>有人会问：既然要重写 kernel，为什么不直接用已经很快的 FlashAttention？两者解决的是不同维度的问题，且可以叠加。FlashAttention 优化的是「一次注意力计算内部」的访存——它用分块（tiling）和在线 softmax 避免把巨大的注意力分数矩阵写回显存，属于计算侧的 IO 优化，见 <a href=\"../../efficient-attention-mechanisms/io-aware/flash-attention\">高效注意力机制 · FlashAttention</a>。PagedAttention 优化的是「KV 缓存怎么在显存里摆放」——属于内存布局侧。</p>\n<p>下表把两者对照清楚：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>FlashAttention</th>\n<th>PagedAttention</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>优化对象</td>\n<td>注意力计算的中间访存</td>\n<td>KV 缓存的物理布局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心手段</td>\n<td>tiling + 在线 softmax</td>\n<td>块表 gather + 非连续块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解决的痛</td>\n<td>分数矩阵写回显存慢</td>\n<td>KV 显存碎片与浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否共存</td>\n<td>能</td>\n<td>能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现实中现代引擎往往把两者融合：kernel 既按块表 gather 分页的 KV，又用 FlashAttention 式的在线 softmax 算分数。分页负责让 KV 省着放，FlashAttention 负责让算得快，各司其职。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代价与收益的账\">代价与收益的账</h2><p>分页 kernel 不是没有成本。相比读一整段连续张量，它多了「查块表、按块跳转」的间接寻址开销，写起来也复杂得多——这正是为什么 PagedAttention 需要一个定制 CUDA kernel 而非几行改动。但这份计算侧的小额税，换来的是内存侧的巨大红利：显存浪费从 60–80% 降到 4% 以下，批量随之数倍放大，见 <a href=\"../foundations/kv-fragmentation\">KV 内存碎片之痛</a>。</p>\n<p>由于 decode 是访存受限而非计算受限的负载，间接寻址那点额外指令几乎被访存等待掩盖，实测对单步延迟影响很小，却把并发撑大了好几倍。这笔账整体大赚，量化数字见 <a href=\"../practice/throughput-gains\">吞吐提升与度量</a>。也正因如此，分页 kernel 的非连续访问一旦设计得当，就成了「几乎免费的内存自由」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分页把 KV 打散，而注意力要访问历史所有 token 的 K、V，标准连续 kernel 无法直接处理。</li>\n<li>PagedAttention kernel 接收块表作为输入，按逻辑块顺序查表 gather 散落的物理块参与运算。</li>\n<li>kernel 分块处理：块内连续访存保住带宽，非连续只在块边界靠块表跳转一次。</li>\n<li>FlashAttention（计算侧 IO 优化）与 PagedAttention（内存布局优化）正交，可融合共存。</li>\n<li>间接寻址的小额计算税被 decode 的访存等待掩盖，换来数倍并发，整体大赚。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"block-tables\">块表与映射</a> — kernel 依赖的块表从何而来</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../practice/throughput-gains\">吞吐提升与度量</a> — 这笔账的量化收益</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../efficient-attention-mechanisms/io-aware/paged-attention\">高效注意力机制 · 分页注意力</a> — 从注意力效率角度看分页</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../efficient-attention-mechanisms/io-aware/flash-attention\">高效注意力机制 · FlashAttention</a> — 可叠加的计算侧优化</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"非连续 KV 存储：kernel 如何在碎片上算注意力","id":"非连续-kv-存储-kernel-如何在碎片上算注意力"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：注意力要访问什么","id":"核心概念-注意力要访问什么"},{"level":2,"text":"按块表 gather：kernel 的新职责","id":"按块表-gather-kernel-的新职责"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么不能直接套用 FlashAttention","id":"为什么不能直接套用-flashattention"},{"level":2,"text":"代价与收益的账","id":"代价与收益的账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"块表与映射：分页机制的中枢","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/paging/block-tables"},"next":{"title":"写时复制：让共享既安全又便宜","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/sharing/copy-on-write"}}